  "worked_solution": "First, let's rewrite our system, highlighting the coefficients:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{\u2032}(t)=(-1)\\cdot {x}_{1}(t)+2\\cdot {x}_{2}(t)+3\\cdot t+2 \\\\ {x}_{2}^{\u2032}(t)=3\\cdot {x}_{1}(t)+(-1)\\cdot {x}_{2}(t)+(-1)\\cdot t+0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in matrix form:\n\n$$\n{x}^{\u2032}(t)=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & -1\\end{aligned}]x(t)+[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]t+[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nwhere $x(t)=[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}(t) \\\\ {x}_{2}(t)\\end{aligned}].$",
